@startuml
title Communication: page load (message flow)

object "Browser\n(app.js: loadItems())" as Browser
object "getDb()" as GetDb
object "Firebase Hosting\n(/__/firebase/init.json)" as Hosting
object "readItems() /\nseedItems()" as Items
object "Cloud Firestore\n((default))" as Firestore

Browser --> GetDb : 1: getDb()
GetDb --> Hosting : 1.1: fetch init.json
Browser --> Items : 2: readItems(db)
Items --> Firestore : 2.1: query(demoItems, orderBy("Id"))
Items --> Firestore : 2.2: runTransaction(seed missing)\n[collection empty]
Items --> Browser : 3: DemoItem[] rendered\n(or error status, app.js:79-82)

@enduml
